@node Issue Workflow
@chapter Issue Workflow
@anchor{issue-workflow}
@cindex issue workflow

This chapter covers the day-to-day commands: create, list, view, edit,
close and reopen, claim, set status and priority, manage dependencies and
labels, and apply bulk actions.  The entry points are the dispatch menu
(@kbd{?}) and the context-aware actions bound in @code{beads-list-mode}
and @code{beads-show-mode} (@pxref{Interface Concepts}).  The complete
command and key lookup is in @ref{Command and Variable Reference}.

