@node Creating Issues
@section Creating Issues
@cindex creating issues

@deffn Command beads-compose-create
Create an issue in a compose buffer named @code{*beads-create[PROJECT]*}.
Press @kbd{c} from the dispatch menu, or run @kbd{M-x
beads-compose-create}.  The first line is the title (an optional
@code{# } prefix is stripped); everything after the first blank line is
the Markdown description.
@end deffn

@example
# Fix login redirect loop

When users log in with SSO they get stuck in a redirect loop
between /auth/callback and /login.

## Steps to reproduce
1. Click "Sign in with SSO"
2. Complete the SSO flow
3. Observe the redirect loop
@end example

