@node Listing Issues
@section Listing Issues
@cindex listing issues

@deffn Command beads-list-issues
List issues in a @code{beads-list-mode} buffer.  From the dispatch menu
press @kbd{l}.  The list menu uses switch-based infixes: toggle filters,
then press a suffix to execute.
@end deffn

@table @asis
@item @strong{Filters}
@kbd{-s} status, @kbd{-t} type, @kbd{-p} priority, @kbd{-a} assignee,
@kbd{-l} label.
@item @strong{Options}
@kbd{-o} sort order, @kbd{-n} limit.
@end table

Press @kbd{l} again inside the menu to list all issues.  The suffix
converts the filter state into a @code{beads-issue-spec} and refreshes
the list buffer.

@table @kbd
@item r
List ready (unblocked) issues.
@item b
List blocked issues.
@item /
In a list buffer, open the spec-based filter menu to refine the current
view.
@end table

@deffn Command beads-list-advanced
The advanced list transient exposes the remaining @command{bd list}
flags.
@end deffn

@deffn Command beads-ready
List ready (unblocked) issues for the current store.
@end deffn

@deffn Command beads-blocked
List blocked issues for the current store.
@end deffn

