@node Sorting Pagination and Movement
@subsection Sorting, Pagination, and Movement
@cindex sorting
@cindex pagination

@table @kbd
@item S
Sort by the column under point.
@item ]
Move to the next page.
@item [
Move to the previous page.
@item G
Jump to a page.
@end table

@vindex beads-list-default-limit
The number of rows shown by default is the user option
@code{beads-list-default-limit}.

@kbd{TAB} and @kbd{S-TAB} move between rows and wrap; @kbd{SPC} previews
the issue at point in another window (@pxref{One Movement Scheme}).

