@node Viewing Issues
@section Viewing Issues
@cindex viewing issues

@deftypefn {Emacs Lisp Function} {} beads-show (issue-id &key directory)
Open ISSUE-ID in a @code{beads-show-mode} buffer.  Press @kbd{RET} on a
list row, or run @kbd{M-x beads-show}.  The buffer renders every field as
collapsible sections with clickable issue references.  DIRECTORY scopes
the view to another store (@pxref{Store Scoping}).
@end deftypefn

@table @kbd
@item n
Next section.
@item p
Previous section.
@item TAB
Next heading or reference (wraps).
@item S-TAB
Previous heading or reference (wraps).
@item SPC
Fold or unfold the section at point.
@item RET
Follow the reference at point.
@item o
Follow the reference at point in another window.
@item g
Refresh.
@item q
Quit.
@end table

